@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra may chu dang chay -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Chi tiet bai tap ton tai -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 4. Chi tiet bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found + ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 5. Nop bai cho bai tap 1 hop le -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### 6. Doc lai luot nop vua tao tu ID -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 7. Nop bai voi du lieu rong -> 400 Bad Request + INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 8. Nop vao bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found + ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### 9. Nop vao bai tap da dong -> 400 Bad Request + ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv002/rest-api"
}

### 10. Nop trung bai tap da nop -> 409 Conflict + DUPLICATE_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### 11. Xoa / rut luot nop -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 12. Doc lai luot nop da xoa -> 404 Not Found + SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 13. Thieu Content-Type khi gui POST -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions

{
  "studentCode": "SV003",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv003/rest-api"
}

### 14. Sai phuong thuc HTTP -> 405 Method Not Allowed
PUT {{api}}/api/assignments/1

